# Ubuntu slim live ISO: gamescope comes from apt (openbox.list.chroot).
# Do NOT list build deps here — live-build would bake them into every squashfs.
# Source-build fallback installs deps inside gamebian-install-gamescope, then
# hook 997 purges /usr/share/gamebian/gamescope-build.list if present.
#
# Optional fallback package names (for purge helper / manual source builds only):
# git build-essential meson ninja-build cmake pkg-config
# libdrm-dev libvulkan-dev libwayland-dev libx11-dev libsdl2-dev
# libpipewire-0.3-dev libliftoff-dev
